--- subject
Delivery problem with order {{ orderNumber }}
--- html
<p>Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p>{{ if kind == "returned_to_sender" }}We could not deliver order {{ orderNumber }}, and the carrier sent it back to us.{{ else if kind == "lost" }}The carrier lost the package for order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else }}We could not deliver order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ end }} Our team will contact you about the next steps.</p>
<p><a href="{{ orderUrl }}">View your order</a></p>
--- text
Hi {{ name }},

{{ if kind == "returned_to_sender" }}We could not deliver order {{ orderNumber }}, and the carrier sent it back to us.{{ else if kind == "lost" }}The carrier lost the package for order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ else }}We could not deliver order {{ orderNumber }}.{{ end }} Our team will contact you about the next steps.

View your order: {{ orderUrl }}
--- title
Delivery problem
--- body
We could not deliver order {{ orderNumber }}.
